      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T06:07:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Depends on how it fails, if FD sends the (compCompatibilityResp \u003d\u003d PLDM_CCR_COMP_CANNOT_BE_UPDATED), then we mark it Failed and continue to the next component as before; CancelUpdate is only sent if nothing was accepted after the last one.\n\nIf the UpdateComponent exchange itself fails (no response, decode error, non-zero completion code), we stop and send CancelUpdate. That stop is the existing behaviour — master already bailed with updateDeviceCompletion(eid, false) on those paths — this patch just takes the FD out of update mode instead of leaving it to time out on FD_T1.",
